  "overhaul": {
    "_doc": "The CrazyGames overhaul (Phase Q + Phase R, docs/CRAZYGAMES_PLAN.md). ON in the CrazyGames build; all_builds = true turns it on in EVERY build (Android, itch) once CrazyGames approves (Yousuf, 2026-11-27: one simple toggle). GameData.overhaul_on / apply_overhaul; Main reads its `overhaul` flag, never `crazygames`, for anything in here. Portal-only things (landscape layout, key hints, no ads, SKIP TUTORIAL) stay in balance.crazygames.",
    "all_builds": false,
    "tagline": "Pop the germs. Survive the swarm.",
    "_presentation": "Merged into balance when the overhaul is on (GameData.apply_overhaul): juice + palette only (drawn bolt size, kill flash/burst, colours). Visual, never gameplay (a test checks only juice/palette are touched).",
    "presentation": {
      "juice": {"bullet_scale": 1.15, "kill_flash_scale": 1.7, "kill_burst_particles": 12, "kill_burst_speed": 1.25},
      "palette": {"background": "#05070f"}
    },
    "_art": "R1 (2026-11-27): 'darkfield' = the dark-field microscope art (assets/processed/overhaul/, built by tools/build_assets.py --overhaul: rim-lit germ atlas with one row per enemy type, player cell, slide floor with a counting grid; bullets/particles/gems/shots drawn additive). '' = the old art. enemy_colors replace data/enemies.json colours (visual only).",
    "art": "darkfield",
    "enemy_colors": {"grunt": "#5dff8f", "swarm": "#d4ff4a", "runner": "#ffd84a", "brute": "#ff5a4a", "spitter": "#ffa040", "charger": "#ff4fd8", "splitter": "#3cf2e0", "boss": "#ff2d55"},
    "_weapon_fx_fever": "S3 (2026-11-28): Fever Spike (evolved nova, weapon_fx.fever): each pulse is a thick heat front (front colour, white-hot core edge, a trailing band) growing to the nova radius over life_s, embers thrown outward, a scorch splat (scorch x radius; 0 = off, it read as a brown goo stain) and germs inside glowing heat_col for heat_s; between pulses (inhale_s) the heat is drawn back into the cell; pulse 2 is white-hot (front2/core2), faster (life2_s), with more embers and a bigger punch. Sounds fever/fever2 (build_assets.build_evolution_sfx). Visual only.",
    "_weapon_fx": "R5 (2026-11-27): weapon spectacle on the dark slide (WorldView, only with art darkfield). bolt: a comet tail of `tail` discs (`tail_evo` when evolved) spaced `tail_gap` radii, a white core, evolved bolts drawn x`evo_scale`; orbit: a faint track (`track_w` x orb size, `track_alpha`) + a halo per orb; nova: an additive shock fill out to the nova radius (`alpha`, `alpha_evo`, `life_s`); chain: every arc gets a glow + white core, `evo_width` thicker when evolved. Visual only.",
    "weapon_fx": {"bolt": {"tail": 3, "tail_evo": 5, "tail_gap": 1.3, "tail_alpha": 0.45, "core_alpha": 0.6, "core_alpha_evo": 0.95, "glow_alpha": 0.14, "evo_scale": 1.3},
      "orbit": {"track_w": 1.2, "track_alpha": 0.1, "halo": 1.9, "halo_alpha": 0.16},
      "nova": {"alpha": 0.14, "alpha_evo": 0.26, "life_s": 0.24},
      "chain": {"width": 1.0, "evo_width": 1.6},
      "fever": {"life_s": 0.42, "life2_s": 0.34, "front_w": 20, "front": "#ff8a2a", "core": "#fff1c2", "front2": "#ffe27a", "core2": "#ffffff",
        "embers": 16, "embers2": 22, "ember_speed": [260, 640], "ember_life": 0.55, "ember_drag": 2.6,
        "heat_s": 0.45, "heat_col": "#ff7a2a", "heat_mix": 0.7,
        "scorch": 0.0, "scorch_col": "#ff6a1a", "inhale_s": 0.3, "fill_a": 0.22, "fill2_a": 0.3,
        "punch": 0.025, "punch2": 0.045, "shake": 4.0, "shake2": 7.0}},
    "_hot_start": "R4 (2026-11-27): a first launch with the overhaul on plays these beats (~75-90 s of action: move, upgrade, Lancer dash, surrounded, elite chest -> evolution, streak horde, Outbreak; no boss) instead of the 3-min Patient Zero, then results offer PLAY CLASSIC (a real run). Same beat format as onboarding.prologue.beats (validated the same way); runs on the prologue mode with overhaul.prologue overrides. Patient Zero stays replayable in full from the menu.",
    "hot_start": {"enabled": true, "beats": [
      {"id": "move", "text": "Drag anywhere to move", "target": "move", "min_s": 1.0, "max_s": 3, "start": {"spawn": [{"id": "swarm", "n": 14, "pattern": "cluster", "dist": 480}, {"id": "grunt", "n": 6, "pattern": "front", "dist": 460}], "ambient": 1.0}, "until": {"moved": 150}},
      {"id": "fire", "max_s": 8, "start": {"ambient": 1.2}, "repeat": {"every_s": 2.0, "spawn": [{"id": "grunt", "n": 6, "pattern": "cluster", "dist": 440}]}, "until": {"kills": 12}},
      {"id": "upgrade", "text": "LEVEL UP! Tap UPGRADE", "target": "upgrade", "pause_after_s": 0.4, "start": {"grant_levels": 1, "offers": [["orbit", "nova", "showcase"]]}, "until": {"picks": 1}},
      {"id": "lancer", "text": "A Lancer! Watch it wind up...", "max_s": 6, "start": {"spawn": [{"id": "charger", "n": 1, "pattern": "front", "dist": 340, "hp_mult": 5}], "ambient": 0.8}, "until": {"lunge": 1}},
      {"id": "dash", "text": "DASH NOW!", "target": "dash", "pause_after_s": 2.0, "until": {"dashes": 1}},
      {"id": "grow", "text": "Tap UPGRADE: pick cards that work together", "target": "upgrade", "show_s": 4.0, "min_s": 12, "max_s": 24, "start": {"ambient": 1.4, "xp_mult": 3.0, "grant_levels": 1, "offers": [["showcase", "partner", "might"], ["showcase", "partner", "haste"], ["showcase", "partner", "swift"]]}, "until": {"picks": 2}},
      {"id": "surround", "text": "Surrounded! DASH through them", "show_s": 3.0, "min_s": 3, "max_s": 8, "start": {"spawn": [{"id": "grunt", "n": 24, "pattern": "ring", "dist": 250}], "ambient": 1.4}, "until": {"dashes": 1}},
      {"id": "elite", "target": "elite", "start": {"elite": true, "elite_life_s": 4, "elite_dist": 380, "ambient": 0.8}, "until": {"chests": 1}},
      {"id": "evolve", "text": "EVOLVED! Max a weapon + its partner", "show_s": 3.0, "max_s": 3.5, "start": {"xp_mult": 1.0}, "until": {"time": 3.5}},
      {"id": "horde", "text": "Keep the streak going!", "show_s": 2.5, "max_s": 12, "start": {"spawn": [{"id": "swarm", "n": 30, "pattern": "ring", "dist": 340}], "ambient": 1.2}, "repeat": {"every_s": 2.0, "spawn": [{"id": "grunt", "n": 16, "pattern": "ring", "dist": 360}, {"id": "swarm", "n": 14, "pattern": "ring", "dist": 430}]}, "until": {"streak": 80}},
      {"id": "outbreak", "text": "OUTBREAK is ready! Tap it", "target": "outbreak", "pause_after_s": 0.4, "start": {"outbreak_full": true}, "until": {"outbreaks": 1}},
      {"id": "frenzy", "max_s": 5, "start": {"spawn": [{"id": "grunt", "n": 28, "pattern": "ring", "dist": 380}], "ambient": 1.8}, "until": {"time": 5}},
      {"id": "finale", "text": "INFECTION COMPLETE", "max_s": 2.5, "start": {"clear": true, "ambient": 0.0}, "until": {"time": 2.5}, "done": {"win": true}}
    ]},
    "_prologue": "Patient Zero with the overhaul on (Phase Q, 2026-11-27): overrides / waves_overrides go on top of onboarding.prologue (GameData.apply_prologue), beats are merged into the beat with that id (GameData.prologue_beats; text \"\" = a silent beat). hp_floor stays above juice.lowhp_frac so the red edge + heartbeat never stick; hide_hurt_label drops the 'what hit you' name under the cell.",
    "prologue": {
      "overrides": {"hp_floor": 0.35, "difficulty": {"damage_taken_mult": 0.5}, "player": {"regen": 2.0}},
